                        "form": "die Stachanowisten"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3be4cb3c-6730-3340-837d-45c54936e59c",
                        "entry_id": "87a8907d-1097-3d45-a52a-ac881a088a6e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "besonders hart und produktiv arbeitender Arbeiter"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aa84c31a-b3aa-4e4b-96f4-03d17244a30c",
                                "sense_id": "3be4cb3c-6730-3340-837d-45c54936e59c",
                                "text": "„Ich kratzte mich am Sack, während dieser Stachanowist die hintere Tür aufmachte und die Einkaufstüten hervorholte, um sie mir vor die Füße zu werfen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "540fa1b2-c02c-4903-aece-3f2c809df066",
                                "sense_id": "3be4cb3c-6730-3340-837d-45c54936e59c",
                                "text": "„Im Schacht ‹Kalinin›, im gleichen Revier, wo der uns bekannte Stachanowist Gorbatjuk arbeitet, begann der Verwalter des Reviers Rijikow die Anwendung der Stachanowmethoden zu hintertreiben.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d947d8cf-c368-42ad-a386-873a22951201",
                                "sense_id": "3be4cb3c-6730-3340-837d-45c54936e59c",
                                "text": "„Der Politkommissar F., ein junger Kroate, war von meiner Leistung begeistert. Er gab mir sein Ehrenwort, daß er binnen einer Woche meine Entlassung aus dem Lager durchsetzen und mich am 1. Mai zum ‚Udarnik‘ (Stachanowist) ernennen werde.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3bb7e908-b4ad-43d7-9eb3-3f3e9718416b",
                                "sense_id": "3be4cb3c-6730-3340-837d-45c54936e59c",
                                "text": "„Sie hatte eine vierschrötige Freundin, die als Drechslerin in einer Traktorenfabrik arbeitete und auch als Stachanowist, also verdiente ›Heldin der Arbeit‹, kaum 350 bis 400 Rubel im Monat verdiente.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "89992f08-a8af-48b1-b432-7983d9611187",
                                "sense_id": "3be4cb3c-6730-3340-837d-45c54936e59c",
                                "text": "„Ihre Aufgabe bestünde darin, die Maschinen umzustellen und Hilfseinrichtungen anzubringen; nur wer selbst ein Stachanowist sei, könne von den Arbeitern Respekt verlangen.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a1076388-7c32-4dc0-9761-ae650fce70c6",
                        "source_entry_id": "87a8907d-1097-3d45-a52a-ac881a088a6e",
                        "source_sense_id": "3be4cb3c-6730-3340-837d-45c54936e59c",
                        "source_sense_description": "besonders hart und produktiv arbeitender Arbeiter",
                        "target_lang_word": "Stakhanovite",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Stakhanovite",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cdd68000-12cd-3c81-9f65-98278427d693",
                                        "entry_id": "d8e4c54a-d8e8-3c94-accb-a3909018990e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An extremely productive or hard-working worker, especially in the former USSR, who may earn special rewards; a workaholic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69c5c7a4-7933-40d6-be3b-6f7896162602",
                                                "sense_id": "cdd68000-12cd-3c81-9f65-98278427d693",
                                                "text": "Nevertheless, few outstanding Stakhanovites remained at the bench for very long. Even if they stayed on the enterprise payroll, they ceased to be workers, becoming instead living icons."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45862de5-bb31-4904-a964-1e8fdd627dfb",
                                                "sense_id": "cdd68000-12cd-3c81-9f65-98278427d693",
                                                "text": "Kolkhozniki were soon attacking the Stakhanovites with abandon, beating them up, destroying their animals, even killing them.⁴⁰ For obvious reasons, collective farm management and even village authorities were often also not eager to see labor norms increased and colluded in these attacks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d433fd1-3b78-48e1-a976-441cf1151c1d",
                                                "sense_id": "cdd68000-12cd-3c81-9f65-98278427d693",
                                                "text": "In mid-1936, the steel plant's deputy director, Khazanov, revealed that according to factory administration data there were 3,663 Stackhanovites at the steel plant, but according to the records of the trade union committee, there were 4,441. “In our shops,” he commented, “there are insufficiently precise criteria for determining Stakhanovites.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Stakhanovite",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f3c1585c-b572-36ee-b962-dc3a46688cf9",
                                        "entry_id": "0db3403b-5032-371a-8a27-ca583e67af10",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to a Stakhanovite; heroically hard-working."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1fdc5077-306e-41e2-ba44-4ccbeda9485f",
                                                "sense_id": "f3c1585c-b572-36ee-b962-dc3a46688cf9",
                                                "text": "Perhaps he was convinced that a more Stakhanovite nation would, simply because of its absolute ethical commitment to community and service, in some way decide to take from the rich and give to the poor; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "afa2e9fb-25d9-4d95-a83c-bc510042ef3c",
                                                "sense_id": "f3c1585c-b572-36ee-b962-dc3a46688cf9",
                                                "text": "The great galvanised iron shed where the valves were made was a cacophonous and tumultuous place, full of Stakhanovite workers torturing plugs of super-heavy metal with screaming drill bits."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ee32b63-dc41-4a75-babe-30f18079e818",
                                                "sense_id": "f3c1585c-b572-36ee-b962-dc3a46688cf9",
                                                "text": "You've got to work hard to be considered the most miserable part of Russia, which makes Murmansk the most Stakhanovite city in Russia."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18e9771a-6bd6-4b2e-9789-5a52a42eea3c",
                                                "sense_id": "f3c1585c-b572-36ee-b962-dc3a46688cf9",
                                                "text": "There was nothing more Stakhanovite than the slogan “We can do a lot! Let's complete the Five Year Plan in four!”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "70371744-332d-41d0-b9ea-8eb5474b723a",
                        "source_entry_id": "87a8907d-1097-3d45-a52a-ac881a088a6e",
                        "source_sense_id": "3be4cb3c-6730-3340-837d-45c54936e59c",
                        "source_sense_description": "besonders hart und produktiv arbeitender Arbeiter",
                        "target_lang_word": "stakhanoviste",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "stakhanoviste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "99a7276c-1251-330e-803c-99509329fe65",
                                        "entry_id": "630bd2c1-7316-3890-a336-2643f453c582",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relatif au stakhanovisme, à l’apologie du travail intensif."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df443072-e33a-48cb-9319-ee70c6ed4e88",
                                                "sense_id": "99a7276c-1251-330e-803c-99509329fe65",
                                                "text": "Ces acteurs stakhanovistes qui monopolisent les écrans."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "stakhanoviste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61e7ee91-de61-31e3-b0aa-59765eeda35d",
                                        "entry_id": "1bebb75f-e83d-31e7-b670-919df382e86c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Travailleur de l’URSS, dévoué à son travail et très productif, modèle du stakhanovisme."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6fd6b3b8-ccee-4923-a42c-47e446c1a1cf",
                                                "sense_id": "61e7ee91-de61-31e3-b0aa-59765eeda35d",
                                                "text": "Dans une des usines que nous visitons, qui fonctionne à merveille […] on me présente un stakhanoviste, dont j’avais vu le portrait énorme affiché sur le mur. Il est parvenu me dit-on, à faire en cinq heures le travail de huit jours […]. Je me hasarde à demander si cela ne revient pas à dire que, d’abord, il mettait huit jours à faire le travail de cinq heures ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c9a0891-f36e-3f6f-a702-7c5ddbf32b59",
                                        "entry_id": "1bebb75f-e83d-31e7-b670-919df382e86c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Travailleur acharné."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "familiar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b5bbe3b-5548-4df0-a42d-f72d69fdfe4b",
                                                "sense_id": "9c9a0891-f36e-3f6f-a702-7c5ddbf32b59",
                                                "text": "Lorsqu’elle arrive à l’abattoir, usée par trois ans de service, cette stakhanoviste de la mise bas a passé la moitié de sa vie dans un box minuscule, avec pour seule occupation de lécher les barreaux de sa cage et de se charger en métaux lourds. — (« Truies : Le porc de l’angoisse », Malbouffe, le dico, Les Dossiers du Canard enchaîné nᵒ 147, avril 2018, page 81)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "968fe639-8f2e-4720-b411-ac3f1727d929",
                                                "sense_id": "9c9a0891-f36e-3f6f-a702-7c5ddbf32b59",
                                                "text": "Triplement étoilé depuis vingt ans, désigné cinq fois « meilleure table du monde », à 69 ans, le chef isérois est un stakhanoviste du travail bien fait."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
